<title>POLAND: ELEKTROBUDOWA NET FALLS IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>ELEKTROBUDOWA NET FALLS IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.53 vs   1.69</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.20 vs   2.40</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.42 vs   2.54</p>
<p> Sales		   19.61 vs  18.69</p>
<p>JANUARY-MARCH</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.86 vs   3.26</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.74 vs   4.94</p>
<p> Operating profit     5.95 vs   5.47</p>
<p> Sales		   52.73 vs  46.13</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish construction company is</p>
<p>Elektrobudowa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
